# Quicklist to CSV

## WTF

If you export from Quicklist to CSV and try to upload that CSV to TCGPlayer it _will not_ work.

This script will turn your Quicklist CSV into something that _will_ work.

## WHY

* Quicklist sends data to the `Lists Tool` on TCGplayer.com and then heads to Staging from there.
* As of Oct 1 2026, the `Lists Tool` is currently broken, and intermittently and unpredictably doubling inventory for many users.
* TCGPlayer is currently recommending users upload via CSV in the Pricing Tab and avoid the `Lists` tool.
* Quicklist does not export to a valid CSV for this purpose because it just gives you TCGPlayer ID (aka SkuId) and the quantity you scanned.

